       "text": "Hi gardening enthusiasts! 🌼😁",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "With today's update to the game the following changes went live:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bugfix: Game no longer has an initial save game even though it was never played",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bugfix: Small objects can now be picked up again when they are placed very close to or below plants",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bugfix: Cat no longer repeats the same idle animation multiple times after a new game was started",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bugfix: Cat no longer jumps on the roof of the garden shed as the jump-animation is not working as intended",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bugfix: Shop no longer displays prices with four or more digits unformatted: Thank you all for playing our game! 😊 Please reach out to us if you have any feedback to share.: Cheers,: the developers! 🤓",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
